  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you create a disguise, you may simultaneously create and wear a second disguise using the same check. Only one of these disguises shows at a time. Alternatively, if you use this talent to create only one disguise, you can simultaneously attempt a Sleight of Hand check to conceal an object on your person. When you use this talent to conceal an object on your person, you can use your Disguise modifier in place of your Sleight of Hand modifier.</p>\n<p>You can remove and destroy the outer disguise as a swift or immediate action to reveal the one beneath or to reveal your underlying appearance. You may doff a disguise in response to someone seeing you, in which case you do so a moment before being seen.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/subterfuge#toc31\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
